# Loop runtime artifacts
.cursor/loop/handoffs/*.json
.cursor/loop/state.json
.cursor/loop/*.md
# Excludes loop/state.json, loop/handoffs/ and the per-run stage outputs, but NOT
# the learnings ledger: CLAUDE.md defines that as persistent cross-agent memory
# "never deleted between runs", and ignoring it made it vanish on every clone.
# Must be `loop/*` rather than `loop/`, or the negations below cannot re-include.
loop/*
!loop/learnings.md
!loop/learnings.jsonl
# Package-upgrade architecture is a durable implementer contract, not a
# per-run scratch file. Track it the same way as the learnings ledger.
!loop/package-upgrade.md
# iOS/mobile launch investigation (architect + product-spec). A gitignored
# architecture.md / spec.md vanishes on clone — same class of defect as
# ignoring the learnings ledger (context/git.md memory rule).
!loop/ios-mobile-launch-architecture.md
!loop/ios-mobile-launch-spec.md
# iOS/mobile launch investigation spec. loop/spec.md stays ignored (reserved
# name, no exception). This filename is the tracked product contract.
!loop/ios-mobile-launch-spec.md
# iOS/mobile launch cost envelope (investigation artifact; not a per-run scratch file).
!loop/ios-mobile-launch-cost.md
# iOS/mobile launch — mobile specialist gap analysis of the /play web client.
!loop/ios-mobile-launch-mobile.md
# Per-run handoffs stay ignored except this investigation's mobile handoff
# (docs stage consumes it).
!loop/handoffs/
!loop/handoffs/mobile-*.json
.claude/handoffs/*.json

# Dependencies & build
node_modules/
dist/
*.log

# Environment
.env
.env.local
